<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cons Diamond mulls offer to minorities.</title>
<headline>Cons Diamond mulls offer to minorities.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Diamond Corp Ltd said on Tuesday that the company's holding company, which holds 98.5 percent of the shares, was considering making an offer to minoritiy shareholders.</p>
<p>The offer was not likely to exceed 10 cents a share, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>If an offer is made and accepted by more than 90 percent of the minorities, the company's listing on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange will be terminated.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
